.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_singapore_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_18_-_changes_made_during_parc_ferme.pdf","publicado":"11.10.26 12:27","piloto":"Lance Stroll","codigo":"STR","sesion":"Qualifying","hecho":"The setup of the suspension has been changed while under parc fermé. The team continued to work on the car beyond the covers-on time.","decision":"Required to start the Race from the pit lane.","decision_es":"Larga la carrera desde el pit lane","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":false},{"id":"04ac7dee623b","titulo":"Doc 80 - Infringement - Car 14 - PU element and changes made during Parc Ferme","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_singapore_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_14_-_pu_element_and_changes_made_during_parc_ferme.pdf","publicado":"11.10.26 12:25","piloto":"Fernando Alonso","codigo":"ALO","sesion":"Qualifying","hecho":"The following Power Unit elements have been used: 6th Turbocharger (TC) In addition, the setup of the suspension has been changed while under parc fermé. The team also continued to work on the car beyond the covers-on time.","decision":"Required to start the Race from the pit lane.","decision_es":"Larga la carrera desde el pit lane","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":false},{"id":"d51b4bbf2972","titulo":"Doc 79 - Infringement - Car 63 - Additional changes to PU elements","url":"https://www.fia.com/system/files/decision-document/2026_singapore_grand_prix_-_infringement_-_car_63_-_additional_changes_to_pu_elements.pdf","publicado":"11.10.26 11:47","piloto":"George Russell","codigo":"RUS","sesion":"Qualifying","hecho":"The following Power Unit elements have been used: 4th Energy Store (ES) 4th Control Electronics Unit (PU-CE)","decision":"Drop of 20 grid positions in the next Race in which the driver participates.","decision_es":"Pierde 20 puestos en la grilla de la próxima carrera","tipo":"grilla","proxima_carrera":true},{"id":"1e62ee4bac02","titulo":"Doc 73 - Infringement - Car 27 - Impeding of Car 55"